{%- capture mau -%}{{ Target.PublishedContent.audience }}{%- endcapture -%}<meta name="description" content="{% if mau == "families" or mau == "faculty" %}Members-only page at Tarrenhurst School (fictional). Sign in to read.{% elsif Target.PublishedContent.summary %}{{ Target.PublishedContent.summary | strip_html | escape }}{% else %}Tarrenhurst School (fictional): a private school website laid out as a prospectus, with three divisions, a course of studies, a six-day rotation computed on the server, house cup standings, an admissions calendar and members-only pages for families and faculty. Built on Raytha, a self-hosted, open-source .NET CMS for private schools.{% endif %}">
